WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:02.240
General Zu is held up by Wuzhao

00:02.320 --> 00:03.240
Then General Zhu

00:03.320 --> 00:05.640
What kind of good person is Zhu Yuanzhi

00:05.720 --> 00:08.440
The Crown Prince recently advocated severe punishment for Zhu Yuanzhi

00:08.520 --> 00:10.760
Grand Tutor Xie is also the Crown Prince's maternal uncle

00:10.840 --> 00:13.760
I fear he might take this opportunity to kick us while we're down

00:13.840 --> 00:14.760
I suspect he

00:14.840 --> 00:16.440
Won't dare disobey the edict

00:16.520 --> 00:18.360
But the matter of marching speed

00:18.440 --> 00:19.840
Can be quite flexible

